                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "634c6152-df71-3910-a3e7-899ab45c09e6",
                        "entry_id": "03c4cc7f-3a57-3dff-9dd0-e331ff0cdc18",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female owner's"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "11426188-7187-4952-828a-b70618607b3c",
                                "sense_id": "634c6152-df71-3910-a3e7-899ab45c09e6",
                                "text": "Но жильцы́ до́ма зна́ли, что Михаи́л Ива́нович — хозя́йкин сын, а хозя́йка до́ма — А́нна Петро́вна.",
                                "translation": "But the tenants knew that Mikhaïl Ivanytch was only the son of the mistress, and that the mistress of the house was Anna Petrovna.",
                                "english": "But the tenants knew that Mikhaïl Ivanytch was only the son of the mistress, and that the mistress of the house was Anna Petrovna."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c2e84d9-ac61-41a5-8642-ebdacd7ca2f1",
                                "sense_id": "634c6152-df71-3910-a3e7-899ab45c09e6",
                                "text": "Да́мы потихо́ньку пошли́ за отпра́вившимся по ле́стнице вперёд Разуми́хиным, и когда́ уже поравня́лись в четвёртом этаже́ с хозя́йкиною две́рью, то заме́тили, что хозя́йкина дверь отворена́ на ма́ленькую щёлочку и что два бы́стрые чёрные гла́за рассма́тривают их обе́их из темноты́.",
                                "translation": "The ladies slowly followed Razumihin, who went on before, and when they reached the landlady's door on the fourth storey, they noticed that her door was a tiny crack open and that two keen black eyes were watching them from the darkness within.",
                                "english": "The ladies slowly followed Razumihin, who went on before, and when they reached the landlady's door on the fourth storey, they noticed that her door was a tiny crack open and that two keen black eyes were watching them from the darkness within."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
